#. module: fetchmail_imap_filter
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:fetchmail_imap_filter.field_fetchmail_server__imap_search_criteria
msgid "IMAP Search Criteria"
msgstr "IMAP vyhľadávacie kritérium"

#. module: fetchmail_imap_filter
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/fetchmail_imap_filter/models/fetchmail_server.py:0
msgid ""
"IMAP folder and search criteria must not contain line breaks, the IMAP "
"server would read the rest of the line as a separate command."
msgstr ""
"IMAP priečinok ani vyhľadávacie kritérium nesmú obsahovať zalomenie "
"riadka, IMAP server by zvyšok riadka prečítal ako samostatný príkaz."

#. module: fetchmail_imap_filter
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/fetchmail_imap_filter/models/fetchmail_server.py:0
msgid ""
"IMAP folder and search criteria must not contain an IMAP literal such as "
"{5}, the IMAP server would wait for data that is never sent."
msgstr ""
"IMAP priečinok ani vyhľadávacie kritérium nesmú obsahovať IMAP literál "
"ako {5}, IMAP server by čakal na dáta, ktoré nikdy neprídu."

#. module: fetchmail_imap_filter
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:fetchmail_imap_filter.field_fetchmail_server__imap_folder
msgid ""
"IMAP mailbox the incoming mails are fetched from, e.g. 'INBOX' or a Gmail "
"label such as 'Odoo' fed by a filter. Non-ASCII characters are encoded to IMAP "
"modified UTF-7 and names containing a space or a special character are quoted "
"automatically. Ignored for POP servers."
msgstr ""
"IMAP schránka, z ktorej sa sťahujú prichádzajúce e-maily, napr. 'INBOX' "
"alebo štítok Gmailu ako 'Odoo' plnený filtrom. Znaky mimo ASCII sa "
"automaticky zakódujú do IMAP modified UTF-7 a názvy s medzerou alebo "
"špeciálnym znakom sa uzavrú do úvodzoviek. Pri POP serveroch "
"sa ignoruje."

#. module: fetchmail_imap_filter
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/fetchmail_imap_filter/models/fetchmail_server.py:0
msgid ""
"IMAP search criteria must start with UNSEEN, so that every search key is "
"combined with UNSEEN. Criteria starting with NOT or OR can match already "
"read mails, which are then fetched and processed on every run."
msgstr ""
"IMAP vyhľadávacie kritérium musí začínať UNSEEN, aby sa každý vyhľadávací "
"kľúč kombinoval s UNSEEN. Kritériá začínajúce NOT alebo OR môžu zasiahnuť "
"aj už prečítané e-maily, ktoré sa potom pri každom behu stiahnu a spracujú."

#. module: fetchmail_imap_filter
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:fetchmail_imap_filter.field_fetchmail_server__imap_search_criteria
msgid ""
"IMAP search criteria selecting which mails are fetched, e.g. '(UNSEEN X-GM-"
"RAW \"deliveredto:odoo@example.com\")' fetches only the mails a catch-all "
"rule delivered to this mailbox. Ignored for POP servers."
msgstr ""
"IMAP vyhľadávacie kritérium určujúce, ktoré e-maily sa stiahnu, napr. "
"'(UNSEEN X-GM-RAW \"deliveredto:odoo@example.com\")' stiahne len tie, "
"ktoré do tejto schránky doručilo catch-all pravidlo. Pri POP serveroch "
"sa ignoruje."

#. module: fetchmail_imap_filter
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/fetchmail_imap_filter/models/fetchmail_server.py:0
msgid ""
"The IMAP Search Criteria field must contain ASCII characters only, the IMAP "
"connection cannot send other characters in a search."
msgstr ""
"Pole IMAP vyhľadávacie kritérium smie obsahovať len ASCII znaky, IMAP "
"spojenie iné znaky vo vyhľadávaní odoslať nevie."

#. module: fetchmail_imap_filter
#: model:ir.model,name:fetchmail_imap_filter.model_fetchmail_server
msgid "Incoming Mail Server"
msgstr "Server prichádzajúcej pošty"
